OL,3,APakistan top court orders ex-PM Imran
OL,4,AKhan be moved to hospital from jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FPakistan's Supreme Court has ordered
OL,7,Fjailed former Prime Minister Imran Khan
OL,8,Fto be moved to hospital, following
OL,9,Fcomplaints about his poor health.
OL,11,FA three-judge panel ordered that the
OL,12,Fcricketer-turned-politician be taken to
OL,13,FShifa International Hospital in
OL,14,FIslamabad in the next 48 hours to be
OL,15,Fexamined by physicians.
OL,17,FThe court also said Khan would be
OL,18,Fallowed weekly meetings with family
OL,19,Fmembers and telephone calls with his
OL,20,Fsons.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
